      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.11.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[Claude Code alerts: Roar shows a sidebar card when a session finishes or needs you, and Settings lets you pick which alerts you get (finished, needs you, macOS notification while Roar is in the background).]]></description>
